[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918288608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106913#issuecomment-2918288608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106913","id":2918288608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t8Yzg","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T04:51:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T04:51:48Z","body":"This is one we might have to discuss in core meeting I suspect.\r\n\r\nWhile the logic is correct and I do agree it's nice to be specific in the code about whether something is uninitialized, I'm slightly concerned it might be compat breaking for third party code.\r\n\r\nAn alternative might be:\r\n* Add `resize_uninitialized()` function\r\n* Change `resize()` function to always zero\r\n\r\nWe could then change existing cases to `resize_uninitialized()` and then keep compatibility for third party code (albeit slower and safer, unless they update their code).\r\n\r\nWe could even change our non-bottleneck code to use the safe `resize()` version. Then in future PR authors would have the choice of which to use.\r\n\r\nOn the flip side PRs would definitely get through that use `resize()` that should have used `resize_uninitialized()`, but that goes with the general paradigm in the other containers. And usually we can identify bottleneck code by profiling and fix as appropriate.\r\n\r\nBut I think we need more opinions on this, and it's a good one for core meeting.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918288608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918878811","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106913#issuecomment-2918878811","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106913","id":2918878811,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t-o5b","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T09:47:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T09:47:47Z","body":"> While the logic is correct and I do agree it's nice to be specific in the code about whether something is uninitialized, I'm slightly concerned it might be compat breaking for third party code.\r\n> \r\n> An alternative might be:\r\n> \r\n> * Add `resize_uninitialized()` function\r\n> * Change `resize()` function to always zero\r\n\r\nThat's a good point! I think I can offer a simple solution though: We'll simply keep `resize` as-is in the codebase (alias to `resize_uninitialized`), but `[[deprecate]]` it. In this way, modules have a window to transition to `resize_uninitialized`.\r\nDoes that address your concerns?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918878811/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918923172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106913#issuecomment-2918923172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106913","id":2918923172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t-zuk","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T10:06:12Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T10:10:50Z","body":"That's an alternative but I think is better to get some consensus at next meeting.\r\nIt might e.g. be an opportunity to introduce a safer resize for non-bottleneck stuff.\r\n\r\nAlso if we have most containers have `resize()` be safe version, it can end up being odd that we have `String` resize _not_ being safe. There are some advantages if we can standardize throughout. But again, for meeting I think.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918923172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918936714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106913#issuecomment-2918936714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106913","id":2918936714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t-3CK","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T10:10:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T10:10:58Z","body":"> That's an alternative but I think is better to get some consensus at next meeting. It might e.g. be an opportunity to introduce a safer resize for non-bottleneck stuff.\r\n> \r\n> Also if we have most containers have `resize()` be safe version, it can end up being odd that we have `String` resize _not_ being safe. Kind of nicer if we can standardize throughout.\r\n\r\nOk, let's discuss it at next core meeting then 👍","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918936714/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963395596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106913#issuecomment-2963395596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106913","id":2963395596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wodQM","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T16:06:19Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T16:06:19Z","body":"Meeting:\r\n\r\nGo ahead with this, leave it for third party modules to `#define` their resize depending on Godot version, ok to remove old `resize()` function.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963395596/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968131733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106913#issuecomment-2968131733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106913","id":2968131733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w6hiV","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T20:56:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T20:56:14Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968131733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]